]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]NOTES rendering in `sase bead show`[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]show[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pyapi[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]show: add the shared note presentation module and render one dated, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]attributed, ordinal-addressed block per note in `sase bead show`, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ACE bead detail pane, and the detail/query JSON payloads.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Append-only write surface[/bold #D7AFFF]                                     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pyapi[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: retire `sase bead update --notes` behind a teaching error and add a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]batch `sase bead update --note` append that mirrors `sase bead close [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]--note`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Note edit and retraction[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]repair[dim] · [dim][/dim]after show, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair: add `sase bead note --edit` and `--remove` with their own [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]events, an `edited` render marker, and drop the clobbering Notes field [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the ACE bead editor modal.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after repair[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update the bead docs, the CLI reference tables, and the sase_beads[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory note to describe the append-only timestamped note log.[/#